  "title": "HUMAN SOFT TISSUE CUTTING WIRE, AND METHOD FOR MANUFACTURING SAME",
  "abstract": "A human soft tissue cutting wire, and a method for manufacturing same according to an embodiment of the present invention comprises: a first step of forming a first stranded wire by using a plurality of wires; a second step of forming a second stranded wire by using the first stranded wire; a third step of washing the second stranded wire by using acetone and alcohol; a fourth step of mounting the second stranded wire having undergone the third step to an arc deposition equipment equipped with a cathode arc source; a fifth step of forming a vacuum of 10-6Torr or less inside an vacuum equipment; a sixth step of cleaning the second stranded wire having undergone the fourth step in the vacuum equipment; and a seventh step of forming, in an environment where the internal temperature of the vacuum equipment is 400 degrees Celsius, a hard film on the surface of the second stranded wire (3) by using a compound containing titanium nitride (TiN).",
